each split corresponds to
0. Default, no split
#   1. A = 0-4, B = 5-9
#   2. A=even, B=odd
#   3. A = 0-4, B = 0-5
#   4. A = 0-1, B = 2-3, C = 4-5...

each result was evaluated on each previous split

the UMAPS in the projected folder of each split are the visualization of the data from each task (including the data in previous tasks?)
on the umap created from the final models
